<title>USA: PECO Peach Bottom 2 restart date unknown.</title>
<headline>PECO Peach Bottom 2 restart date unknown.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The restart of PECO Energy Co's 1,100 megawatt Peach Bottom nuclear power unit, which automatically shut late Tuesday, is still pending, the company said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;There was an electrical problem with the turbine generator,&quot; said company spokesman Michael Wood, noting the unit was near full power when the main turbine tripped off line at 1114 EDT Tuesday.</p>
<p>--H McCulloch, New York Power Desk +212-859-1628</p>
</text>
